# Upstream keeps docs/ out of the tree as a personal scratch area. 需求/使用/开发
# under docs/ are deliverable documentation and must be tracked, so exclude the
# contents rather than the directory - git cannot re-include a path whose
# parent directory is itself excluded.
docs/*
!docs/需求/
!docs/使用/
!docs/开发/
!docs/README.md

# Personal scratch notes (not part of the plugin)
t.md
new_t.md
